  "details": "There are many different languages that are not possible to select on vrchat. Adding hundreds of languages would of course be bad but how about letting you type in iso code of any language to pick it?\n\nThis would solve the issue of many posts asking for various specific languages to be added. For example writing \"tok\" would let you find the language \"toki pona\" found under ISO 639:t.\n\nA way to implement would for example be to keep the standard languages as is so its easy to pick those frequent ones but also the ability to find (search for) any language under the different ISO lists for languages.",
